 (the plugin's next own change), and one undo took back both. A drag (gesture begin to end) is one step now, a change without a gesture one step at once. The bridge tells what a save carries (WclapSaveCause): \"own\" (clap.state mark_dirty only) is a step of its own as before, \"params\" joins the step of the parameter edits before it (editing.append), else an undo of a later step handed the plugin the old values its state still held, \"other\" (a load) joins the next step as before. No save while the plugin's GUI drags a parameter.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"gofiber/fiber","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T12:52:10Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"45c16564945bb638202008314b943767bb1d40a2","github_link":"https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/commit/45c16564945bb638202008314b943767bb1d40a2","commit_subject":"🧹 chore: mark the sequential tests instead of keeping a baseline file","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ClickHouse/ClickHouse","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T12:51:49Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"1ee85719b4c8a5a54e13582f1c7221d2de6f6d0f","github_link":"https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/commit/1ee85719b4c8a5a54e13582f1c7221d2de6f6d0f","commit_subject":"Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master' into no-fasttest-slow-tests-127994","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"apache/datafusion","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T12:51:18Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"6a9a1298e6f23afbc17c8f72ce130aac5edb1aef","github_link":"https://github.com/apache/datafusion/commit/6a9a1298e6f23afbc17c8f72ce130aac5edb1aef","commit_subject":"chore: Update to arrow/parquet `60.1.0` (#26867)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"PyPSA/linopy","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-01T12:50:54Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"e0051094081861314e5ad0ecc09ecfbe7b13bda3","github_link":"https://github.com/PyPSA/linopy/commit/e0051094081861314e5ad0ecc09ecfbe7b13bda3","commit_subject":"spec: one input shape per kind of data, with polars frames (#1093)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"tnodir/fort","comm